{"completed": true, "response": "<escape>{\n  \"valid\": true,\n  \"entry\": \"第一眼落在左上方的大面积白色文字，字号最大、亮度最高，紫色竖线进一步强化了文字块的视觉入口。右上角彩色阶段目录是次级入口，其中最后一条紫色文字“忽然怕他不再需要自己”相对突出。下方音符动画亮度较低，不太争夺注意力。\",\n  \"grasp_who\": \"他似乎开始担心对方有一天不再需要自己，甚至觉得和他待着也不自在；但是否已经发生了什么，第一眼不确定。\",\n  \"grasp_feel\": \"不安、没底、害怕失去。\",\n  \"missed\": \"他想起对方一直没有退开，两人眼下仍然亲近，也许对方同样喜欢他在身边，因此他有些高兴；最初的担忧并没有得到回答，只是暂时不再占满他的心思。\",\n  \"burden\": [\n    \"单块太长，一块里连续包含具体担忧、突然安静、回忆现实中的亲近、短暂高兴以及情绪余波，信息层次较多。\",\n    \"核心的具体处境和他因此产生的反应需要沿着长段连续往下看，不能只凭最醒目的开头短语完整获得。\",\n    \"右上角阶段目录是多条连续的小字，需要在几条之间辨认当前阶段；虽然最后一条有颜色和粗细强调，但字号明显弱于正文。\"\n  ],\n  \"score\": 2\n}</escape>", "metadata": {"session_handle": "0f44c221-0358-42d3-bb26-d270e3fdf2af", "session_revision": 0, "session_ttl_max_hours": 6, "job_directory": "D:\\musicclaude\\gpt2agent-safechain\\runs\\gpt4\\pro-bridge-20261110T014846032106Z", "elapsed_seconds": 51.219, "completed_utc": "2026-11-10T01:49:37.245905+00:00", "model": "gpt-5-6-thinking", "thinking_effort": "max", "temporary": true, "unpersonalized": true, "generation_policy_verified": true, "request_policy": {"model": "gpt-5-6-thinking", "thinking_effort": "max", "history_and_training_disabled": true, "temporary_chat_requests_personalization": false, "is_do_not_remember": false, "continuation": false, "unpersonalized_inherited_verified": false, "body_sha256": "d1bce33e77f60d550053dc81f79d1702d2c78eb0e636d0518489a6a539fbe288", "attachment_count": 1}, "stream_completion": {"sse_done": true, "message_completed": true, "independent_terminal_verified": true}, "profile": "Nozomi Kasaki / gpt4", "account_sha256": "bbd4fd636d4b6714d2b42b89e341bdb5bbe7c34f7d141aec76b444be8343fe54", "transport": "probridge-pure-http", "resume_requests": 0, "topic_connections": 0, "browser_started": false, "Docker_used": false, "automatic_retry": false, "initializer_pss_limit_mib": "not_applicable_no_browser", "attachment_count": 1, "code_sha256": {"tools\\chatgpt_web\\gpt3_cli.py": "96a4cdb6cd5d982f4d1de5b6ba8fae0cf23ee44aa3e41d7fdf6968